  data: {
    LLM: "Value spades highly. A hand with the Ace of Spades in the hole is extremely powerful â€” it guarantees the highest-spade requirement. Focus on building the best hand while holding strong spades.\n\nTrack spades on the board: if the Aâ™  is visible in someone's up-cards, they have a huge advantage. If most high spades are mucked or visible, estimate which spades remain in play. With no spades in your hand, you literally cannot win â€” fold unless you can improve.\n\nThe carryover mechanic changes strategy dramatically when the pot is large. Players with high spades in the hole should play aggressively to build a monster pot they can scoop. Monitor opponents' visible spades to assess whether the pot will likely carry over or be claimed.",
